{"about_the_game":"Beach Bass is a 3D vehicle platform game. The aim of the game is to overcome the obstacles and overcome the areas presented to you and complete the game. Beach Bass has multiple modes, and one of them provides a leader board system where all players can compare their scores. But there is no checkpoint in this mode, so you have to be careful and fast.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is actually simple, if you are patient enough!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll you have to do is bring the music to the party with your vehicle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*You will encounter many obstacles, but these should not prevent you from joining the party.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Your reflexes and driving skills are very important in this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*There will be no checkpoints in the game unless you are a crybaby.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Various troubles will happen to you throughout the game, but THE IMPORTANT THING IS TO JOIN THE PARTY!!!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2924620?t=1741014479","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741014479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741014479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741014479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Beach Bass is a 3D vehicle platform game. The aim of the game is to overcome the obstacles and overcome the areas presented to you and complete the game. Beach Bass has multiple modes, and one of them provides a leader board system where all player